2b:["$","div","Getting better translations",{"className":"space-y-3","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"font-display text-lg font-semibold","children":"Getting better translations"}],[["$","p","Machine translation works best on simple, comple",{"className":"text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground md:text-base","children":"Machine translation works best on simple, complete sentences. Avoid slang, abbreviations and idioms, which are often translated literally. “It’s raining cats and dogs” will not make sense in Hindi if translated word by word, so write what you mean: “It is raining heavily.”"}],["$","p","Names of people, places and brands should stay a",{"className":"text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground md:text-base","children":"Names of people, places and brands should stay as they are. After translating, check that numbers, dates and amounts are unchanged. For messages that need a polite tone, consider whether the output uses the correct level of formality, such as “आप” instead of “तुम”."}]],null,null]}]
2c:["$","div","When not to rely on machine translation",{"className":"space-y-3","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"font-display text-lg font-semibold","children":"When not to rely on machine translation"}],[["$","p","Machine translation is a convenience, not a cert",{"className":"text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground md:text-base","children":"Machine translation is a convenience, not a certified translation. For legal agreements, court documents, medical instructions, immigration paperwork or anything where a mistake has consequences, use a qualified human translator and have it certified if the authority requires it."}],["$","p","For official government forms, use the version p",{"className":"text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground md:text-base","children":"For official government forms, use the version published in Hindi by the department rather than translating the English form yourself."}]],["$","ul",null,{"className":"list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-5 text-sm text-muted-foreground","children":[["$","li","Use certified translators for legal and official use",{"children":"Use certified translators for legal and official use"}],["$","li","Ask a Hindi speaker to proofread important messages",{"children":"Ask a Hindi speaker to proofread important messages"}],["$","li","Do not paste confidential documents into any online translator",{"children":"Do not paste confidential documents into any online translator"}]]}],null]}]
2d:["$","div","Useful everyday uses",{"className":"space-y-3","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"font-display text-lg font-semibold","children":"Useful everyday uses"}],[["$","p","People use translators to understand SMS alerts,",{"className":"text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground md:text-base","children":"People use translators to understand SMS alerts, read notices from schools or housing societies, write notes to domestic help, check product instructions and learn new words. Pair it with a dictionary if you want to study a word’s meanings and usage."}]],null,null]}]
2e:["$","div","Typing Hindi without a Hindi keyboard",{"className":"space-y-3","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"font-display text-lg font-semibold","children":"Typing Hindi without a Hindi keyboard"}],[["$","p","If you want to translate Hindi to English but do",{"className":"text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground md:text-base","children":"If you want to translate Hindi to English but do not have a Devanagari keyboard, you do not need to install anything complicated. On Android and iPhone, open Settings, add the Hindi keyboard (many phones also offer a phonetic “Hinglish” layout that turns Roman letters into Devanagari as you type) and switch to it when you need it. On Windows and Mac you can add Hindi as an input language from the system settings and switch with a keyboard shortcut."}],["$","p","You can also copy Hindi text from a WhatsApp mes",{"className":"text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground md:text-base","children":"You can also copy Hindi text from a WhatsApp message, a PDF, a news page or a notice and paste it directly into the left box. Pasting avoids typing mistakes, which matter because one wrong matra can change the meaning of a word."}]],["$","ul",null,{"className":"list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-5 text-sm text-muted-foreground","children":[["$","li","Add the Hindi keyboard in your phone’s language settings",{"children":"Add the Hindi keyboard in your phone’s language settings"}],["$","li","Use a phonetic Hindi layout if you are comfortable typing in Roman letters",{"children":"Use a phonetic Hindi layout if you are comfortable typing in Roman letters"}],["$","li","Paste text instead of retyping it to avoid spelling errors",{"children":"Paste text instead of retyping it to avoid spelling errors"}]]}],null]}]
2f:["$","div","Common translation pitfalls and how to avoid them",{"className":"space-y-3","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"font-display text-lg font-semibold","children":"Common translation pitfalls and how to avoid them"}],[["$","p","Words with several meanings are the biggest sour",{"className":"text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground md:text-base","children":"Words with several meanings are the biggest source of errors. “Bank” can mean a financial institution or the side of a river, “fair” can mean a market or something just, and “paper” can mean a newspaper, an exam or the material. When a translation looks odd, add a few words of context to the sentence, for example “I went to the bank to deposit money”, so the engine can pick the right meaning."}],["$","p","Formality is the second big problem. English has",{"className":"text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground md:text-base","children":"Formality is the second big problem. English has one word for “you”, while Hindi has तू, तुम and आप. Machine translation usually picks a neutral form, so read the output and change it if you are writing to an elder, a customer or an officer. Gender is another trap: Hindi verbs change with the gender of the speaker and the listener, and the tool cannot always know who is speaking."}],["$","p","Finally, check numbers and units. Amounts in lak",{"className":"text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground md:text-base","children":"Finally, check numbers and units. Amounts in lakh and crore, dates written as day/month/year and measurements such as bigha, acre or square feet should be re-read carefully after translating, because a small mistake in a figure is worse than a clumsy sentence."}]],["$","ul",null,{"className":"list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-5 text-sm text-muted-foreground","children":[["$","li","Add context to ambiguous words such as bank, fair or paper",{"children":"Add context to ambiguous words such as bank, fair or paper"}],["$","li","Adjust आप, तुम and तू to suit the person you are writing to",{"children":"Adjust आप, तुम and तू to suit the person you are writing to"}],["$","li","Re-check amounts, dates and measurements after translating",{"children":"Re-check amounts, dates and measurements after translating"}],["$","li","Keep names, addresses and brand names unchanged",{"children":"Keep names, addresses and brand names unchanged"}]]}],null]}]
30:["$","div","Using the translator for study, work and travel",{"className":"space-y-3","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"font-display text-lg font-semibold","children":"Using the translator for study, work and travel"}],[["$","p","Students can use the tool to check the meaning o",{"className":"text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground md:text-base","children":"Students can use the tool to check the meaning of a paragraph in a textbook, but should write their own answers instead of copying the output, since examiners can recognise machine-translated text. A better habit is to translate a sentence, then try to rebuild it yourself from memory and compare."}],["$","p","At work, the translator is handy for understandi",{"className":"text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground md:text-base","children":"At work, the translator is handy for understanding a customer’s message or drafting a quick reply. Read the final text aloud, or ask a colleague who knows the language, before you send anything that represents your company. When travelling, translate short phrases such as asking for directions or the price of an item, and keep the sentences simple."}]],null,null]}]
